%% ⚠️ 历史设计快照（M3 设计期）：图中 revive(...) / 救回 已废止（见口径裁定表 C12），
%%    现为「养护恢复」（未满 3 天浇水 1 次 / 满 3 天浇水 3 次 + 施肥 1 次）；枯萎阈值现为 3 天。勿照此实现。
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 孩子/家长
    participant GP as GardenPage
    participant PG as PlantGrowthService
    participant PR as PlantRepository
    participant FR as FocusRepository
    participant LD as SunlightRepository
    participant SR as SettingsRepository

    Note over U,SR: ① 种植（扣费 + 落 Plant）
    U->>GP: 选物种种植(potIndex)
    GP->>PG: plant(speciesId, potIndex, now)
    PG->>SR: getSettings() → tier
    PG->>LD: balance()
    LD-->>PG: bal
    alt bal < 种植价
        PG-->>GP: 提示阳光不足
    else 余额充足
        PG->>LD: append(net=-cost, refType='plant_plant')
        PG->>PR: savePlant(Plant(seed, plantedAt=now, growthProgress=0, status=growing))
        PG-->>GP: Plant
    end

    Note over U,SR: ② 成长计时 tick（软绑定 + WFD 系数）
    U->>GP: 打开花园 / 定时触发
    GP->>PG: tickAll(now)
    loop 每株 Plant
        PG->>PG: 计算 elapsed 跨过的每天
        PG->>FR: sessionsOfDay(dayKey) → _hasValidFocusDay?
        FR-->>PG: bool(hasWFD)
        PG->>PG: factor = hasWFD ? kGrowthFactorFocused(1.3) : 1.0
        PG->>PG: growthProgress += elapsedHours / (growthHoursPerStage / factor)
        alt progress >= 1.0
            PG->>PG: 进阶段(seed→sprout→adult)；adult满→status=bloomed；重置 water/fertilizerUsed
        end
        alt now - lastWaterAt > kPlantWiltDays(7)
            PG->>PG: status=wilting, wiltedAt=now
        else wilting 且 now - wiltedAt > kPlantWiltDays(7)
            PG->>PG: status=dead
            PG->>LD: append(net=+0.3*cost, refType='plant_death_refund')
            PG->>PR: deletePlant / 释放 pot
        end
        PG->>PR: savePlant(updated)
    end

    Note over U,SR: ③ 浇水加速 / 枯萎救回
    U->>GP: 点浇水
    GP->>PG: water(plantId, now)
    PG->>LD: append(net=-kPlantWaterCost, refType='plant_water')
    PG->>PG: 剩余时间×0.7；waterUsed=true；lastWaterAt=now（重置枯萎计时）
    PG->>PR: savePlant
    U->>GP: 点救回(wilting)
    GP->>PG: revive(plantId, now)
    PG->>LD: append(net=-kPlantReviveCost, refType='plant_revive')
    PG->>PG: status=growing, wiltedAt=null, lastWaterAt=now
    PG->>PR: savePlant

    Note over U,SR: ④ 家长阳光赠予（设置页）
    participant PS as ParentSettingsPage
    U->>PS: 赠予阳光
    PS->>LD: append(net=+amount, refType='parent_gift')
    Note over PS: 日/月上限经 dayKey/monthKey 统计 ≤ kParentGiftDaily(20)/kParentGiftMonthly(150)

    Note over U,SR: ⑤ 删除入口（合规 §10.4 C5，先导后清）
    participant PD as ParentDeletePage
    participant DM as DataManagementService
    U->>PD: 确认删除全部数据
    PD->>DM: clearAll()
    DM->>PR: deleteAll (Plants/Tasks/...)
    DM->>LD: deleteAll (ledger)
    DM->>SR: deleteSettings
    DM->>DM: SettingsStore.clear + SecureStore.clearPin
    DM-->>PD: 完成

    Note over U,SR: ⑥ 专注报告聚合（G2 可读）
    participant RP as ParentReportPage
    participant RS as FocusReportService
    U->>RP: 打开报告(周/月)
    RP->>RS: weeklyReport(now) / monthlyReport(now)
    RS->>FR: sessionsOfDay / countValidFocusDaysLastWeek
    RS->>LD: dayNet / balance
    RS-->>RP: WFD/时段分布/稳定度/阳光汇总
